"document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522106006:0":{"text":"什么？！这——这怎么行！这群无耻的——","source_cn":"什么？！这——这怎么行！这群无耻的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD30EF32C06E6828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1522106006":{"text":"什么？！这——这怎么行！这群无耻的——","source_cn":"什么？！这——这怎么行！这群无耻的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD30EF32C06E6828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522106010:0":{"text":"学者，请冷静。我们已经明确了小赛穆虚弱的原因，只需要一点魔法就可以挽救他的生命。","source_cn":"学者，请冷静。我们已经明确了小赛穆虚弱的原因，只需要一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE392152FA86ED8DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522106011:0":{"text":"即使你通晓世间全部药理，也难以和这一点魔力相比。","source_cn":"即使你通晓世间全部药理，也难以和这一点魔力相比。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FE860FB773354F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1522106012:0":{"text":"你……你太狂妄了！","source_cn":"你……你太狂妄了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C3C2CDEED3546CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1522106013:0":{"text":"比博大人，梅林女士曾经救过小赛穆的命。我相信她，小赛穆也相信她！求求您，不要赶她出去！","source_cn":"比博大人，梅林女士曾经救过小赛穆的命。我相信她，小赛穆...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD65048D842D9A975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1522106014:1":{"text":"我当然知道她是梅林，魔法师协会的人。否则我也不会赶她出去！","source_cn":"我当然知道她是梅林，魔法师协会的人。否则我也不会赶她出去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE96E328176C17B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1522106015:0":{"text":"但你刚说她曾救过你孩子的命，这事是真的吗？","source_cn":"但你刚说她曾救过你孩子的命，这事是真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9818165AD7ED6246","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522106016:0":{"text":"是啊，当然是真的！如果你不信，我可以找人作证！","source_cn":"是啊，当然是真的！如果你不信，我可以找人作证！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB68B1862FE66BE7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1522106017:0":{"text":"哼……鉴于这孩子的病情，我暂且允许你们在城内停留。","source_cn":"哼……鉴于这孩子的病情，我暂且允许你们在城内停留。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90AFEC7CF348F65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1522106018:0":{"text":"但是，那个穿黑袍的人——必须时刻在隆尔的看守下，绝不能靠近任何呼临人！","source_cn":"但是，那个穿黑袍的人——必须时刻在隆尔的看守下，绝不能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D1EEB7F7540F84C","variant_status":"